mindmap
  root((X-Ray by Looplet))
    Purpose
      Headless takeoff engine
      PDF in / quantities out
      No UI — presentation delegated
      LLM never makes a number
    Pipeline
      1 Extract · PyMuPDF
      2 Reassemble glyph-split runs
      3 Grammar to typed entities
      4 Scale voting per page
      5 Checks chain/trig/count
      6 Quantify rule packs
      7 Write JSON + marked PDF
    Entities
      DIM dimensions
      TAG door/window
      SCALE · SPEC
      LABEL · LEVEL
      STD · NOTEKEY
    Trust tiers
      reconciled
      single-source
      needs-human
    Outputs
      takeoff.json / schema
      marked.pdf / Revu-compatible
      embedded attachment
    Stack
      Python 3.11
      PyMuPDF / MuPDF
      pikepdf / qpdf
      pytest + jsonschema
    Guardrails
      No animated fill UX
      No live-updating legend
      No visual template search
      Local-only / no cloud OCR
